00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:59.020
So do you remember Booze Cruise?

31
00:00:59.420 --> 00:00:59.840
Of course.

32
00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:00.280
All right.

33
00:01:00.440 --> 00:01:02.280
So here's the deal about Booze Cruise, you guys.

34
00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:03.680
These were night shoots.

35
00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:05.420
We never did night shoots.

36
00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:06.180
That's true.

37
00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:08.000
We would show up for Booze Cruise.

38
00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:10.780
We had to go to a boat in Long Beach.

39
00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:12.680
We had to get there at like 4 p.m.

40
00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:14.540
And we filmed till like 5 in the morning.

41
00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:17.840
Well, one of the fun things was that we all got hotel rooMs.

42
00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:18.300
I know.

43
00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:20.400
So it was like a big slumber party.

44
00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:23.000
Jenna, I have been wanting to ask you this question.

45
00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:25.160
I don't know why I've never asked you this question.

46
00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:28.140
But did you have to do the puking scene?

47
00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:28.840
No.

48
00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:29.520
What?

49
00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:31.400
Yeah, I didn't have to do it.

50
00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:32.320
Son of a...

51
00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:32.800
I know.

52
00:01:32.960 --> 00:01:33.440
I know.

53
00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:35.180
A lot of you guys did though, right?

54
00:01:35.660 --> 00:01:36.100
Yes.

55
00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:36.980
Here's the thing.

56
00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:40.760
Greg Daniels thought it'd be really funny if a bunch of people in the episode got seasick.

57
00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:41.160
Yes.

58
00:01:41.360 --> 00:01:41.560
Yeah?

59
00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:44.020
Well, a lot of people in real life got seasick.

60
00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:46.380
Oh, in real life, people were like turning green.

61
00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:47.620
Yacking off the side of that boat.

62
00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:48.300
I know.

63
00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:53.040
It had this like subtle like roll back and forth.

64
00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:53.320
Yeah.

65
00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:55.500
And people got like, they got like really sick.

66
00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:57.400
And everyone had those bracelets with the little...

67
00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:58.140
Which don't really work.

68
00:01:58.260 --> 00:01:59.120
They don't work, you guys.

69
00:01:59.260 --> 00:02:00.640
Sorry to whoever makes them.

70
00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:02.740
But we didn't have success with them.

71
00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:05.600
Anyway, so here we are shooting all night long.

72
00:02:05.720 --> 00:02:06.780
And Greg comes up to me.

73
00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:08.100
It's like 1 in the morning.

74
00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:09.920
Greg Daniels, our showrunner, creator.

75
00:02:10.120 --> 00:02:13.460
And he's like, hey, Angela, will you do some of the puking stuff?

76
00:02:13.660 --> 00:02:14.920
Kate Flannery is going to do it.

77
00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:15.640
I was like, what?

78
00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:19.140
He was just grabbing random people to get puking shots.

79
00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:23.680
In between scenes, he would take the B camera operator and we would go out on the back of

80
00:02:23.680 --> 00:02:24.100
the boat.

81
00:02:24.400 --> 00:02:25.960
And you had two choices.

82
00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:29.700
You could take a big swig of cold minestrone soup.

83
00:02:29.840 --> 00:02:30.280
Oh, boy.

84
00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:32.260
Or cold cream of mushroom.

85
00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:33.120
What did you pick?

86
00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:33.660
Oh, God.

87
00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:35.020
It was so disgusting.

88
00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:36.420
I took a big swig.

89
00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:37.340
Do you have any guesses?

90
00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:40.240
I'm guessing you picked minestrone.

91
00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:41.500
That's what I would have picked.

92
00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:41.940
Yes.

93
00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:43.120
That's what I picked.

94
00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:44.000
I picked minestrone.

95
00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:50.940
And they said, okay, take a huge swallow and hold it in your mouth until we say action.

96
00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:53.280
And on action, spew it out.

97
00:02:53.580 --> 00:03:01.220
And I want you to know the 10 seconds it took them to get the camera ready, holding that cold

98
00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:02.680
soup in my mouth.

99
00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:08.380
I literally started to physically gag, like, and then on action, they were like, spew.

100
00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:10.660
And then none of it ended up in the episode.

101
00:03:10.820 --> 00:03:11.840
Oh, my gosh.

102
00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:12.340
None of it.

103
00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:16.220
And we did like three takes of fake puking off the side of the boat.

104
00:03:16.360 --> 00:03:17.080
That's gross.

105
00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:20.300
And that is a sneak peek of Office Ladies.

106
00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:21.560
